- F4 [Nit] withdrawn. plan.md lines 25-31 and 51-53 document the [b] convention and its owners.
- F5 [Nit] spec.md Judge and plan.md Task 4 and Task 9: The calibration record and the PM report
  record have no named file path; the spec says the maker "records the result" and Task 4 says
  "record the result file". Rationale: The run folder measure/runs/asset_storytime_l2_cards_20261106/
  owns these records, so the maker picks only a file name inside a named folder; the choice changes
  no delivered picture, test, or script.

